# Example household panel: 200 A split-phase service, 42-space panel.
# Leg A is loaded heavier than leg B, so `breakerbox balance` has work to do.
service 200 A
spaces 42

# name                    | legs | breaker A | load A | continuous?
Kitchen counter receptacles | A  | 20 | 14
Living room receptacles     | A  | 15 | 8
Garage receptacles          | A  | 20 | 16 | yes
Bedroom 1 lighting          | B  | 15 | 3
Bathroom receptacles        | B  | 20 | 5
Furnace blower              | B  | 15 | 6
Range                       | AB | 50 | 36
Clothes dryer               | AB | 30 | 22
Heat pump                   | AB | 40 | 25 | yes
EV charger                  | AB | 40 | 32 | yes
